{"id":"3b0149ed221ad66a","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination.md","title":"通过删除可空位置消除空产生式","display":"df-cfg-epsilon-elimination — 通过删除可空位置消除空产生式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination","aliases":["73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination"],"display":"df-cfg-epsilon-elimination — 通过删除可空位置消除空产生式","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables]]","[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§4.4, Theorem 4.3, pp. 90–91; scans 98–99","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cfg-epsilon-elimination — 通过删除可空位置消除空产生式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec4c645913320961\" href=\"?note=ec4c645913320961\" title=\"73-df-cfg-nullable-variables\">73-df-cfg-nullable-variables</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§4.4, Theorem 4.3, pp. 90–91; scans 98–99"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\)</span>。可空集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec4c645913320961\" href=\"?note=ec4c645913320961\" title=\"73-df-cfg-nullable-variables\">73-df-cfg-nullable-variables</a>，文法语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{DeleteNull}_G(\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e:\\{0,\\ldots,|\\beta|-1\\}\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|\\alpha|-1\\}\\;[&amp;\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\beta|-1\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\Longrightarrow e(i)&lt;e(j))\\\\&amp;\\land\\beta=\\langle\\alpha(e(i)):0\\le i&lt;|\\beta|\\rangle\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\alpha|-1\\}\\;(j\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\Longrightarrow\\alpha(j)\\in\\operatorname{Nullable}(G))].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{DeleteNull}_G(\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e:\\{0,\\ldots,|\\beta|-1\\}\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|\\alpha|-1\\}\\;[&amp;\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\beta|-1\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\Longrightarrow e(i)&lt;e(j))\\\\&amp;\\land\\beta=\\langle\\alpha(e(i)):0\\le i&lt;|\\beta|\\rangle\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\alpha|-1\\}\\;(j\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\Longrightarrow\\alpha(j)\\in\\operatorname{Nullable}(G))].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nP^-\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\beta)\\in V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^+:\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;((A,\\alpha)\\in P\\land\\operatorname{DeleteNull}_G(\\alpha,\\beta))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nP^-\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\beta)\\in V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^+:\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;((A,\\alpha)\\in P\\land\\operatorname{DeleteNull}_G(\\alpha,\\beta))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G)\\coloneqq(V,\\Sigma,P^-,S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G)\\coloneqq(V,\\Sigma,P^-,S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格递增的保留位置函数禁止调换或复制字符；被删位置必须可空。只将非空 β 加入 P⁻，因此输出文法直接生成 L(G) 去掉空词的部分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-nullable-variables","status":"resolved","id":"ec4c645913320961","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-nullable-variables","status":"resolved","id":"ec4c645913320961","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$。可空集见 [[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables]]，文法语言见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$。可空集见 [[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables]]，文法语言见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{DeleteNull}_G(\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e:\\{0,\\ldots,|\\beta|-1\\}\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|\\alpha|-1\\}\\;[&\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\beta|-1\\}\\;(i<j\\Longrightarrow e(i)<e(j))\\\\&\\land\\beta=\\langle\\alpha(e(i)):0\\le i<|\\beta|\\rangle\\\\&\\land\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\alpha|-1\\}\\;(j\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(e)\\Longrightarrow\\alpha(j)\\in\\operatorname{Nullable}(G))].\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nP^-\\coloneqq\\{(A,\\beta)\\in V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^+:\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;((A,\\alpha)\\in P\\land\\operatorname{DeleteNull}_G(\\alpha,\\beta))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EpsFree}(G)\\coloneqq(V,\\Sigma,P^-,S)","display":true}],"bytes":2183,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination|通过删除可空位置消除空产生式]]"},{"id":"ed2034a0209d609d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$；$\\operatorname{EpsFree}$ 见 [[73-df-cfg-epsilon-elimination]]，可空语义见 [[73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness]]。"}],"outgoing":["ec4c645913320961","97562bc4aa1d6014"]}